  "body": "To download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/CVNP\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this in Red Beach are becoming increasingly hard to find. 24a Bay Street offers a relatively flat, freehold 377m² section in a superb location, just a short walk from the beach and the Red Beach shopping hub.\r\n\r\nThis is a location built around lifestyle. Morning swims, paddleboarding, beach walks and even the odd surf day are all part of life here. The Red Beach Surf Club sits at the heart of the community, with everything from the Nippers programme and local events to raffles, Crave catering bbqs and an easy spot to catch up with friends over an affordable drink.  The kids will enjoy an easy walk to Red Beach Primary School and having the brand new 'pump track' nearby. \r\n\r\nBut what really sets this section apart is what has already been done.\r\n\r\nBuild your own fabulous beach pad or enjoy having plans underway for two smaller dwellings, giving you an exciting head start should you wish to explore the development opportunity. Watercare has also confirmed the ability to connect to wastewater, with wastewater and stormwater connections already located on the driveway.\r\n\r\nBuild the beachside home you've always wanted, or explore the potential of creating two dwellings and making the most of this increasingly sought-after coastal location.\r\nNear Flat. Freehold. Beachside. Consented.\r\n\r\nWhether it's lifestyle, development or a combination of both, this is a rare chance to secure your own piece of Red Beach.",
